  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (adding G.S. 14-269.9(b) and (c)): {+(b)+} {+Prohibition. – It is unlawful to leave a firearm in an unattended motor vehicle unless the vehicle is locked and the firearm is either (i) secured with a trigger lock or other safety device designed to prevent an unauthorized user from operating the firearm or (ii) in a locked container.+} {+(c)+} {+Penalty. – Any person who violates subsection (b) of this section is guilty of a Class 2 misdemeanor.+}"
